ntents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le01ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le01ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm glad you're all present for this meeting. I hope to have wrapped up the agenda by ten o'clock.  If you won't be here, you'll have to talk with me later. It won't do us any good if we're not on the same page.  On a more positive note, I'd like to say that I know you've been really pulling together to try to make things run smoothly. You're getting better with non-verbal communication ... smiling more, most of you. The one thing I want to reiterate is that I prefer the fridges to have been checked both morning and night for supplies. To have known the fridge was broken first thing in the morning would have averted the disaster that ensued today.<br/>\nTomorrow we'll be closed for lunch as I hope to have resolved our fridge problem. Jim won't work with the staff here, so I've told him to come tomorrow. I expect all of you to have come in for four o'clock to prepare for dinner.\n<br>Concerning customer relations, you've all been working hard. I would prefer not to have run out of mussels, but stuff happens!\n<br>So you have the morning off tomorrow.  I hope you get some R and R. Unless there are questions, you can go.  Umm, Rachel, I'd like to have a word with you.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le01ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "74800", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: Yeah.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Listen Rachel, I don't want to make any presumptions, but I feel like something's going on with you. Are you okay?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:  Well, I cannot stand some of the customers to be honest. I would prefer to have continued being a dishwasher or cook sometimes. I can't stand how pompous they are. A lot of them have a cultural bias towards me.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le01ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "98500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  It's difficult dealing with customers, I agree, but if you won't pull yourself together in front of them, that's a problem. I want to support you Rachel ...  but why on earth did you take your shoes and socks off in the dining room? I won't tolerate it if you do anything unprofessional in front of customers again. Do you understand why?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I guess.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le01ob03re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn11le01ob03re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}